> pc(x: u16) = popcount(x)
> pbits(x: u16) = (x&1)+((x>>1)&1)+((x>>2)&1)+((x>>3)&1)+((x>>4)&1)+((x>>5)&1)+((x>>6)&1)+((x>>7)&1)+((x>>8)&1)+((x>>9)&1)+((x>>10)&1)+((x>>11)&1)+((x>>12)&1)+((x>>13)&1)+((x>>14)&1)+((x>>15)&1)
> equiv pc pbits
pc and pbits are equal on the domain of pc (exhaustive)
> range pc
range of pc -> u16:
  0..16   (17 distinct values)
  values: 0..16
  fits in u5
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> clz16(x: u16) = clz(x)
> range clz16
range of clz16 -> u16:
  0..16   (17 distinct values)
  values: 0..16
  fits in u5
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> domain clz16
domain of clz16:
  x: u16, 0..65535
  C assumes x != 0  (__builtin_clz)
  defined at 65536 of 65536 points
  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 65536 points of the domain
